{"seq":7,"slug":"software-supply-chain-security","title":"软件供应链安全","stage":"DONE","category":"cybersecurity-applied","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security","rating":{"composite":3.92,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 软件供应链安全 简介\n\n软件供应链安全关注的是这样一条事实：现代软件极少完全由自己编写，而是由海量第三方依赖、开源组件、构建工具、镜像与发布流水线层层拼装而成。任何一个环节被污染，恶意代码都可能顺着这条链子直达生产环境与终端用户。从 SolarStorm/SolarWinds 的构建系统投毒，到 npm、PyPI 上层出不穷的恶意包与抢注包，再到 2024 年险些酿成大祸的 XZ Utils 后门事件，过去几年反复证明：攻击者已经把目标从\"攻破你的应用\"转向\"攻破你信任的上游\"。守住供应链，就是守住信任本身。\n\n本手册面向工程团队与安全团队，讲清楚如何系统性地保护从依赖、到构建、再到发布的整条软件供应链。它不只罗列威胁，更强调可落地的工程实践——如何让每一个进入产物的组件都有据可查、每一次构建都不可被篡改、每一条发布都经过策略校验。无论你是负责依赖治理的研发负责人，还是在搭建可信构建体系的平台与安全工程师，都能从中找到对应的方法与取舍。\n\n全书共分四章，沿着\"识别威胁—保证完整—治理来源—强制策略\"的脉络层层递进。\n\n第一章**供应链威胁与攻击面**先建立全局认知，剖析依赖投毒、抢注、构建系统入侵、签名与凭据窃取等典型攻击手法，帮助团队看清自己真正暴露的攻击面在哪里。\n\n第二章**制品完整性与溯源**进入防御核心，讲解如何用签名、校验、软件物料清单（SBOM）与来源证明（provenance）为每一个产物建立可验证的身份与履历，让\"这个二进制到底是谁、从什么源码、经哪条流水线构建出来的\"变成可回答的问题。\n\n第三章**依赖与开源治理**面向最高频的风险来源，覆盖依赖清单管理、漏洞扫描、版本与许可证治理，以及如何在引入开源便利与控制其风险之间取得平衡。\n\n第四章**安全构建与策略执行**把前面的原则落到流水线上，讲解如何加固构建环境、实现可复现与隔离构建，并通过自动化的策略闸门，把安全要求强制嵌入发布流程而非依赖人工自觉。\n\n建议读者按章顺序阅读：先理解威胁全貌，再掌握完整性与溯源这一根本保障，进而做好依赖治理，最后用安全构建与策略执行把整套能力固化为流水线上的硬约束。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"supply-chain-threats","title":"供应链威胁与攻击面","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/supply-chain-threats","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"supply-chain-attack-landscape","title":"供应链攻击全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/supply-chain-threats/supply-chain-attack-landscape"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dependency-and-typosquatting-attacks","title":"依赖与抢注攻击","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/supply-chain-threats/dependency-and-typosquatting-attacks"},{"seq":3,"slug":"build-and-cicd-attacks","title":"构建与 CI/CD 攻击","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/supply-chain-threats/build-and-cicd-attacks"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"artifact-integrity-and-provenance","title":"制品完整性与溯源","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/artifact-integrity-and-provenance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sbom-and-dependency-inventory","title":"SBOM 与依赖清单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/artifact-integrity-and-provenance/sbom-and-dependency-inventory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"artifact-signing-sigstore","title":"制品签名与 Sigstore","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/artifact-integrity-and-provenance/artifact-signing-sigstore"},{"seq":3,"slug":"slsa-and-build-provenance","title":"SLSA 与构建溯源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/artifact-integrity-and-provenance/slsa-and-build-provenance"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"dependency-and-oss-governance","title":"依赖与开源治理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/dependency-and-oss-governance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dependency-management-and-scanning","title":"依赖管理与扫描","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/dependency-and-oss-governance/dependency-management-and-scanning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vulnerability-management-and-vex","title":"漏洞管理与 VEX","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/dependency-and-oss-governance/vulnerability-management-and-vex"},{"seq":3,"slug":"oss-risk-and-curation","title":"开源风险与策展（OSS Risk and Curation）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/dependency-and-oss-governance/oss-risk-and-curation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"secure-build-and-policy","title":"安全构建与策略执行","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/secure-build-and-policy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hardened-build-pipelines","title":"加固的构建流水线（Hardened Build Pipelines）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/secure-build-and-policy/hardened-build-pipelines"},{"seq":2,"slug":"policy-as-code-and-admission","title":"策略即代码与准入控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/secure-build-and-policy/policy-as-code-and-admission"},{"seq":3,"slug":"supply-chain-incident-response","title":"供应链事件响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/software-supply-chain-security/secure-build-and-policy/supply-chain-incident-response"}]}]}